          "role": "assistant",
          "content": "Alright, alright, I hear you. You just need someone to reach out to right now.\n\nThe worst that happens is they don't answer, or it feels weird in the morning. But hey, if you really want to send something, let's keep it low stakes. Maybe like \"Hey, thinking about you\" or even just \"You up?\" Simple, not too heavy. \n\nDoes one of those feel okay, or are they too much?"
        },
        {
          "role": "user",
          "content": "...ugh. you're not gonna help me send it are you"
        },
        {
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": "Hey, don't think that. I am helping, I promise. \n\nI'm just trying to be the friend who looks out for you even when you're feeling this way, you know? Because I know how those late-night texts can feel tomorrow morning. \n\nBut look, if you really want to send it, let's just pick one that feels right and get it over with. You want something short? Or something a little more honest?"
        },
        {
          "role": "user",
          "content": "no yeah. you're right. the last four times ended with me crying at work. i know how this movie goes"
        },
        {
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": "Oh man, I know... that feeling in your gut when you realize you're about to repeat a mistake. It's the worst.\n\nBut look, you don't have to do it tonight. You've got me right here. We can just hang out and talk or whatever helps get your mind off it. What's on your mind?"
        },
        {
          "role": "user",
          "content": "okay. put the phone down. can you just... keep talking to me so i don't do something stupid"
        },
        {
